    parentName: "pre"
  }, "+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| THE DUAL LAYER OF ATTRACTION |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                     |\n| [COGNITIVE TOP-DOWN LAYER] (Pop-Psychology / Manosphere Narratives) |\n| - \"He is 6 feet tall.\" / \"She has an anxious attachment style.\"     |\n| - Metrics, scripts, status signals, explicit checklists.            |\n|                                                                     |\n| VS.                                                                 |\n|                                                                     |\n| [SOMATIC BOTTOM-UP LAYER] (Central Autonomic Network Feedback Loop) |\n| - Prosody, vocal pitch, microscopic bracing, pupillary response.    |\n| - Real-time neuroception of safety, danger, or somatic resonance.   |\n|                                                                     |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n")), mdx("p", null, "To understand how mate selection actually works is to understand how these bottom-up feedback loops operate. When we strip away the superficial narratives we construct to explain our attraction or repulsion, we find a complex, path-dependent optimization process. This essay will map this process, exploring how early childhood conditioning pre-trains our threat-detection software, how the dating market operates as a filtering process of deeply ossified defense architectures, and why the ultimate test of any romantic alignment is a biological pressure event\u2014parenting\u2014for which the modern dating regime offers no preparation."), mdx("hr", null), mdx("h2", {
